  SuitSprite: {fileID: 0}
  CardStory: "But I am no longer there.\r\n\r\nSpades2 stands at attention on the
    walls. Clubs2 is here, of course. Spades2 thinks she\u2019s been pulling on favors
    or something, so that they get paired on guard duty again. Their divisions rarely
    share duties usually. I swallow a bite of bread without chewing. No longer in
    the mess hall. No chewing. It\u2019s tough, old and flavorless, Spades can barely
    swallow. \r\n\r\nYes, this is how it is described. Standard fare. Rations are
    allowed with more frequency during the lower temperature periods. So I do as
    Spades companions and swallow more frequently. The temperature is certainly low,
    out here. The cold weather makes Spades2 reminisce. I remember last winter, huddled
    in the lower quarters with the rest of their squad because there was little wood
    for heating. I gave her my coat, remember?\r\n\r\nClubs2 blinks and her eyes
    widen."
